/target

# Impeccable design tooling: keep the surface briefs (direction contract), the
# design sidecar, the chosen decision sketch and the seed record; the rest is
# local working state (review screenshots, logs, unchosen sketches, caches).
/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
/.impeccable/review/
/.impeccable/questions/*.log
/.impeccable/questions/roll.json
/.impeccable/mocks/decision/*
!/.impeccable/mocks/decision/r2-pick.html
